  (text "Limb: 4 low-side channels. Muscle wire k runs from the Vin hole to hole Wk. W1/W2 and W3/W4 are the antagonist pairs." (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 52b5da38-6f39-4204-a55f-3efdf09e90d6))
  (text "Flyback diodes may be fitted DNP if the wire leads are short. Gate pull-downs keep every MOSFET off when the 74HC595 outputs are disabled." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1ccc3f49-4dbb-47de-9b6d-42d93f1143d1))
  (text "AO3400A pins: 1 G, 2 S, 3 D (SOT-23)." (at 20 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c2043ef4-875d-4791-b10a-27602485ea66))
  (text "Gate guard (hardware, no software involved): CAC AC-couples the drive, RPD bleeds it, the BAT54 clamp restores the low level each cycle." (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 17f9f550-1b8d-4c1d-94c2-f073c1318af3))
  (text "Normal pulses (up to ~250 us) pass with a few percent droop; a gate stuck high decays below threshold in ~3 ms (22 nF x 100 k). Use 100 nF with IRLZ34N." (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f344927-66e3-4d0c-9847-95f50126a7c4))
)
